            "pk": "17855874330525721",
            "text": "🎉 Zehn.ai — PitchWinner at S-TRON Shanghai 2025!\n\nAfter a rigorous selection process, Zehn.ai has been chosen to pitch live on stage at S-TRON SHANGHAI 2025! 🚀\n\nZehn.ai is an innovative R&D lab developing fundamental AI models, including SoroLLM — the first large language model built specifically for the Tajik language.\n\n📌 This is a historic milestone for the Central Asian AI ecosystem, proving that regional innovation can make a global impact! 🌍\n\nCongratulations to Zehn.ai on this well-deserved achievement — we can’t wait to cheer you on in Shanghai!\n\n📍 When: September 23–24, 2025\n📍 Where: West Bund Art Center, Shanghai"
